  "comments": [
    {
      "paragraph_index": 2,
      "comment": "pH 7"
    },
    {
      "paragraph_index": 3,
      "comment": ""
    },
    {
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "comment": "Trace elements (MnSO4·5H2O; ZnSO4·7H2O; CuSO4·5H2O; H3BO3; (NH4)6Mo7O4·4H2O; CoCl2·6H2O) are not essential when the purity of the water is not very high, e.g., when tap water is used. Therefore, adding glucose (0.1%), for example, to the above mineral medium in the Table can enhance the harvest of algal cells."
    }
  ]
